{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":3901,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8dba4c64e810824e9b82ec0a7fd787a2","RawContent":"Mine reads:\n \n &lt;div align=\"center\"&gt;In a Caribbean Paradise\n Together with our Parents\n We Invite you to Share with us \n The Sun, the Sea and the Sand \n As we become Husband and Wife\n \n Name\n &amp;amp;\n Name\n \n Date\n Time\n \n Location\n \n At Home Reception to Follow\n details enclosed&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":343521,"PostDate":1213644254,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Mine reads:<br \/> <br \/> <div align=\"center\">In a Caribbean Paradise<br \/> Together with our Parents<br \/> We Invite you to Share with us <br \/> The Sun, the Sea and the Sand <br \/> As we become Husband and Wife<br \/> <br \/> Name<br \/> &<br \/> Name<br \/> <br \/> Date<br \/> Time<br \/> <br \/> Location<br \/> <br \/> At Home Reception to Follow<br \/> details enclosed<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>Erin & Martin<\/strong><strong>EdenH Real Arena<\/strong><span>Punta Cana, Dominican Republic January 13, 2009<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i67.photobucket.com\/albums\/h304\/loveisblonde2\/biggestloser4x1.jpg\">http:\/\/i67.photobucket.com\/albums\/h3...stloser4x1.jpg<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;116\/st\/20090113\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f487\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...f487\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"becksy@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1209200819,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209200.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":130,"PhotoHeight":97,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Becksy","Id":209200,"Name":"Becksy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":3901,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"877a1542f0ec896ea56b3e27bd21d0ec","RawContent":"I love all of these but I&#039;m wondering something. If the parents of the bride are paying for the wedding, shouldn&#039;t the wording include them?","Attachments":[],"Id":343806,"PostDate":1213655578,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I love all of these but I'm wondering something. If the parents of the bride are paying for the wedding, shouldn't the wording include them?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i412.photobucket.com\/albums\/pp201\/ameandmatt\/DSC_0222-1-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i412.photobucket.com\/albums\/p...C_0222-1-1.jpg<\/a><br><br><span>url=<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/%5D\">http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/]<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;80\/st\/20081220\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/f43b\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...f43b\/event.png<\/a><br><span>[\/url]amesharpe's wedding review<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t35146\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t35146<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"amesharpe@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1199815511,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208170.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":74,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amesharpe","Id":208170,"Name":"amesharpe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":3901,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b059cde04d9f6457e12ba8653428e1ff","RawContent":"I kept the invitation traditional, but made the RSVP qwirky. &#039;will join you as you make your big splash&#039;, &#039;will join you for the bahamian welcome dinner&#039; and &#039;must wave the invitation, i&#039;m all tide up&#039;","Attachments":[],"Id":349198,"PostDate":1213938737,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I kept the invitation traditional, but made the RSVP qwirky. 'will join you as you make your big splash', 'will join you for the bahamian welcome dinner' and 'must wave the invitation, i'm all tide up'\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ultimateme143@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1213813860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210039.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ultimateme143","Id":210039,"Name":"ultimateme143","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":3901,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f065d42dd14461602455cade6bc533d","RawContent":"&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Beach Invite Wording 1&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n An ocean ripple upon the shore\n Two hearts alone we&#8217;ll be no more;\n For on this day I say to you\n My love, my life, my soulmate &#8220;I do&#8221;\n \n Melissa Ann Wilson\n And\n Jeffrey Scott Martin\n \n Invite you to join them\n barefoot, on the beach\n Saturday, the twelfth of May\n Two thousand and seven\n As the sun sets at\n Six o&#8217;clock in the evening\n Old Biscayne Resort\n Santa Rosa, Florida\n \n Reception to follow \n \n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Beach Invite Wording 2&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n Sea of Love.... \n As precious as the ocean&#039;s treasures, \n too strong for anyone to measure; \n two hearts joined together, \n sharing their lives forever. \n \n Ryan Philip Imwold and Carolyn Celia Stribling\n Announce their marriage, May 12th, 2oo7 in St. Lucia\n \n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Beach Invite Wording 3&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n A tropical paradise is the setting,\n a romantic getaway for our wedding,\n \n Please join us as we,\n Tammy McGregor\n and\n Kevin McMinniman\n Join our lives together in marriage\n Monday, the fifteenth of January\n two thousand and eight\n On the beach at the\n Sunset Royal Resort in Cancun , Mexico \n \n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Beach Invite Wording 4&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n Hand in hand we walk the sand\n Our footsteps will fall true\n For on this day I say to you\n My love, my life &amp;quot;I do&amp;quot; \n \n Melissa Ann Wilson\n And\n Jeffrey Scott Martin\n \n Invite you to join them\n barefoot, on the beach\n Saturday, the twelfth of May\n Two thousand and seven\n As the sun sets at\n Six o&#8217;clock in the evening\n Old Biscayne Resort\n Santa Rosa, Florida\n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Beach Invite Wording 5&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n We will walk side-by-side along the sand\n hand-in-hand . . . forever\n Mr. and Mrs. John Rakira\n request the honour of your presence\n at the marriage of their daughter\n Amy Cathryn\n to\n John Fredrick Toope\n on Saturday, the fourth of August\n two thousand and nine\n at one o&#039;clock\n St. Timothy&#039;s Church\n Johnsville, Idaho\n \n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Beach Invite Wording 6&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n Like a butterfly in a summer breeze,\n our hearts are uplifted by love\n It is with joy that we,\n Nikole Marie Gardner\n and\n Joseph Henry Catepiler\n pledge our love as one\n on Saturday, the fourth of August\n two thousand and nine\n at four o&#039;clock\n St. Paul&#039;s Church\n Massillon, Ohio\n \n You are invited to share\n this day of happy beginnings\n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Beach Invite Wording 7&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n Years ago when they were young\n two lovers were brought\n together as one.\n Now and forever, partners in life\n under palm trees swaying, they&#039;ll\n be husband and wife.\n \n Alexa and John\n look forward to sharing with you\n the sun, the sea and the\n memories of their wedding ceremony.\n \n Saturday, the eighth of May\n two thousand and nine\n at five o&#039;clock\n The Royal Bahamian Resort.\n Cable Beach, Bahamas\n \n Sunset reception following ceremony\n \n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Beach Invite Wording 8&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n Start writing your toast\n Because Anne and Mike\n Will wed at the coast\n \n On July 18, 2007\n Fisherman&#8217;s Pier\n Wrightsville Beach, North Carolina\n \n Sunset reception following ceremony\n \n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Beach Invite Wording 9&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n Please join us\n on our wedding day\n as the sun sets o&#8217;er the bay\n \n We, Kelly Hampton and Michael Smith\n will exchange our marriage vows\n \n At Sunset, Thursday, June 18, 2009\n Under the gazebo\n Sandals Negril Resort\n Negril, Jamaica\n \n Reception to follow\n \n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Beach Invite Wording 10&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n We picked the date\n the theme is set\n We&#8217;re having a luau\n you&#8217;ll never forget\n \n Near the sea and the spray\n you&#8217;re invited to join us\n and share our special day\n \n Mai and Terry&#8217;s wedding\n will take place\n Friday, June 25, 2009, 6:00pm\n on the beach\n at the Seaside Inn\n Negril, Jamaica \n \n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Fun Sayings for Beach Wording&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n Fun sayings for beach wedding!\n \n It&#039;s a Shore Thing...We&#039;re Getting Married\n \n Together, we wrote our names in the sand and the waves washed them away, so we will write them in our hearts and there they will stay.\n \n To love and to be loved is to feel the sun from both sides. \n \n A romantic affair...\n something special is in the air!\n \n We&#039;re hooked on each other\n We cast our lines\n into the sea of love,\n and we both hooked a keeper!\n \n \n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Love Quotes Beach Wording&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n I love you\n Not only for what you are,\n But for what I am\n When I am with you.\n \n I love you\n Not only for what\n You have made of yourself,\n But for what\n You are making of me.\n \n I love you\n For the part of me\n That you bring out.\n Roy Croft\n \n \n \n Come live with me, and be my love, And we will some new pleasures prove Of golden sands, and crystal brooks, With silken lines, and silver hooks.\n -John Donne\n \n Immature love says: &#039;I love you because I need you.&#039; Mature love says &#039;I need you because I love you.&#039;\n -Erich Fromm\n \n Love is an irresistible desire to be irresistibly desired.\n -Robert Frost\n \n Life without love is like a tree without blossoms or fruit.\n -Kahlil Gibran\n \n In true love the smallest distance is too great, and the greatest distance can be bridged.\n -Hans Nouwens\n \n Can miles truly separate you from friends... If you want to be with someone you love, aren&#039;t you already there?\n -Richard Bach\n \n Love is life and if you miss love, you miss life.\n -Leo Buscaglia","Attachments":[],"Id":514197,"PostDate":1227128176,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <strong><u>Beach Invite Wording 1<\/u><\/strong><br \/> An ocean ripple upon the shore<br \/> Two hearts alone we&#8217;ll be no more;<br \/> For on this day I say to you<br \/> My love, my life, my soulmate &#8220;I do&#8221;<br \/> <br \/> Melissa Ann Wilson<br \/> And<br \/> Jeffrey Scott Martin<br \/> <br \/> Invite you to join them<br \/> barefoot, on the beach<br \/> Saturday, the twelfth of May<br \/> Two thousand and seven<br \/> As the sun sets at<br \/> Six o&#8217;clock in the evening<br \/> Old Biscayne Resort<br \/> Santa Rosa, Florida<br \/> <br \/> Reception to follow <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <strong><u>Beach Invite Wording 2<\/u><\/strong><br \/> Sea of Love.... <br \/> As precious as the ocean's treasures, <br \/> too strong for anyone to measure; <br \/> two hearts joined together, <br \/> sharing their lives forever. <br \/> <br \/> Ryan Philip Imwold and Carolyn Celia Stribling<br \/> Announce their marriage, May 12th, 2oo7 in St. Lucia<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <strong><u>Beach Invite Wording 3<\/u><\/strong><br \/> A tropical paradise is the setting,<br \/> a romantic getaway for our wedding,<br \/> <br \/> Please join us as we,<br \/> Tammy McGregor<br \/> and<br \/> Kevin McMinniman<br \/> Join our lives together in marriage<br \/> Monday, the fifteenth of January<br \/> two thousand and eight<br \/> On the beach at the<br \/> Sunset Royal Resort in Cancun , Mexico <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <strong><u>Beach Invite Wording 4<\/u><\/strong><br \/> Hand in hand we walk the sand<br \/> Our footsteps will fall true<br \/> For on this day I say to you<br \/> My love, my life \"I do\" <br \/> <br \/> Melissa Ann Wilson<br \/> And<br \/> Jeffrey Scott Martin<br \/> <br \/> Invite you to join them<br \/> barefoot, on the beach<br \/> Saturday, the twelfth of May<br \/> Two thousand and seven<br \/> As the sun sets at<br \/> Six o&#8217;clock in the evening<br \/> Old Biscayne Resort<br \/> Santa Rosa, Florida<br \/> <br \/> <strong><u>Beach Invite Wording 5<\/u><\/strong><br \/> We will walk side-by-side along the sand<br \/> hand-in-hand . . . forever<br \/> Mr. and Mrs. John Rakira<br \/> request the honour of your presence<br \/> at the marriage of their daughter<br \/> Amy Cathryn<br \/> to<br \/> John Fredrick Toope<br \/> on Saturday, the fourth of August<br \/> two thousand and nine<br \/> at one o'clock<br \/> St. Timothy's Church<br \/> Johnsville, Idaho<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <strong><u>Beach Invite Wording 6<\/u><\/strong><br \/> Like a butterfly in a summer breeze,<br \/> our hearts are uplifted by love<br \/> It is with joy that we,<br \/> Nikole Marie Gardner<br \/> and<br \/> Joseph Henry Catepiler<br \/> pledge our love as one<br \/> on Saturday, the fourth of August<br \/> two thousand and nine<br \/> at four o'clock<br \/> St. Paul's Church<br \/> Massillon, Ohio<br \/> <br \/> You are invited to share<br \/> this day of happy beginnings<br \/> <br \/> <strong><u>Beach Invite Wording 7<\/u><\/strong><br \/> Years ago when they were young<br \/> two lovers were brought<br \/> together as one.<br \/> Now and forever, partners in life<br \/> under palm trees swaying, they'll<br \/> be husband and wife.<br \/> <br \/> Alexa and John<br \/> look forward to sharing with you<br \/> the sun, the sea and the<br \/> memories of their wedding ceremony.<br \/> <br \/> Saturday, the eighth of May<br \/> two thousand and nine<br \/> at five o'clock<br \/> The Royal Bahamian Resort.<br \/> Cable Beach, Bahamas<br \/> <br \/> Sunset reception following ceremony<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <strong><u>Beach Invite Wording 8<\/u><\/strong><br \/> Start writing your toast<br \/> Because Anne and Mike<br \/> Will wed at the coast<br \/> <br \/> On July 18, 2007<br \/> Fisherman&#8217;s Pier<br \/> Wrightsville Beach, North Carolina<br \/> <br \/> Sunset reception following ceremony<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <strong><u>Beach Invite Wording 9<\/u><\/strong><br \/> Please join us<br \/> on our wedding day<br \/> as the sun sets o&#8217;er the bay<br \/> <br \/> We, Kelly Hampton and Michael Smith<br \/> will exchange our marriage vows<br \/> <br \/> At Sunset, Thursday, June 18, 2009<br \/> Under the gazebo<br \/> Sandals Negril Resort<br \/> Negril, Jamaica<br \/> <br \/> Reception to follow<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <strong><u>Beach Invite Wording 10<\/u><\/strong><br \/> We picked the date<br \/> the theme is set<br \/> We&#8217;re having a luau<br \/> you&#8217;ll never forget<br \/> <br \/> Near the sea and the spray<br \/> you&#8217;re invited to join us<br \/> and share our special day<br \/> <br \/> Mai and Terry&#8217;s wedding<br \/> will take place<br \/> Friday, June 25, 2009, 6:00pm<br \/> on the beach<br \/> at the Seaside Inn<br \/> Negril, Jamaica <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <strong><u>Fun Sayings for Beach Wording<\/u><\/strong><br \/> Fun sayings for beach wedding!<br \/> <br \/> It's a Shore Thing...We're Getting Married<br \/> <br \/> Together, we wrote our names in the sand and the waves washed them away, so we will write them in our hearts and there they will stay.<br \/> <br \/> To love and to be loved is to feel the sun from both sides. <br \/> <br \/> A romantic affair...<br \/> something special is in the air!<br \/> <br \/> We're hooked on each other<br \/> We cast our lines<br \/> into the sea of love,<br \/> and we both hooked a keeper!<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <strong><u>Love Quotes Beach Wording<\/u><\/strong><br \/> I love you<br \/> Not only for what you are,<br \/> But for what I am<br \/> When I am with you.<br \/> <br \/> I love you<br \/> Not only for what<br \/> You have made of yourself,<br \/> But for what<br \/> You are making of me.<br \/> <br \/> I love you<br \/> For the part of me<br \/> That you bring out.<br \/> Roy Croft<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Come live with me, and be my love, And we will some new pleasures prove Of golden sands, and crystal brooks, With silken lines, and silver hooks.<br \/> -John Donne<br \/> <br \/> Immature love says: 'I love you because I need you.' Mature love says 'I need you because I love you.'<br \/> -Erich Fromm<br \/> <br \/> Love is an irresistible desire to be irresistibly desired.<br \/> -Robert Frost<br \/> <br \/> Life without love is like a tree without blossoms or fruit.<br \/> -Kahlil Gibran<br \/> <br \/> In true love the smallest distance is too great, and the greatest distance can be bridged.<br \/> -Hans Nouwens<br \/> <br \/> Can miles truly separate you from friends... If you want to be with someone you love, aren't you already there?<br \/> -Richard Bach<br \/> <br \/> Love is life and if you miss love, you miss life.<br \/> -Leo Buscaglia\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.momentville.com\/VasandJulia\"><strong>*Click To See Our Wedding Website*<\/strong><\/a><br><strong>27 Booked So Far<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"Jewls567@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1226613670,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212661.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jewls567","Id":212661,"Name":"jewls567","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":3901,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b1a3eda415000fb66a6afe9469f296bf","RawContent":"I love the fairy tale one. I may use it.","Attachments":[],"Id":514212,"PostDate":1227129023,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I love the fairy tale one. I may use it.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http&#58;\/\/i666.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv21\/shellrg72\/dreams%20wedding\/0484.jpg\">http&#58;\/\/i666.photobucket.com\/albums\/v...dding\/0484.jpg<\/a><br \/>\n<span>[IMG]<a href=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http&#58;\/\/www.thebump.com\/?utm_source=ticker&utm_medium=HTML&utm_campaign=ti\">http&#58;\/\/www.thebump.com\/?utm_source=ticker&utm_medium=HTML&utm_campaign=ti<\/a><span> ckers\"><img src=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http&#58;\/\/global.thebump.com\/tools\/tickers\/tt375c9.aspx\">http&#58;\/\/global.thebump.com\/tools\/tickers\/tt375c9.aspx<\/a><span>\" alt=\" Trying to Conceive Ticker\" border=\"0\" \/><\/a>[\/IMG]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mrballerina@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1206659015,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208938.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon To Be Mrs. Gomez","Id":208938,"Name":"Soon To Be Mrs. Gomez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":3901,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d5919dae683f4078d1232e76b6a6a784","RawContent":"&lt;font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"&gt;&lt;font color=\"Magenta\"&gt;I am so glad I came across this thread. I have been wondering about wording for my invites. I love these...now I just have to choose which one I like.....ohhhhh the choices! &lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":514228,"PostDate":1227129782,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"><font color=\"Magenta\">I am so glad I came across this thread. I have been wondering about wording for my invites. I love these...now I just have to choose which one I like.....ohhhhh the choices! <\/font><\/font>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i44.tinypic.com\/aemd8w.jpg\">http:\/\/i44.tinypic.com\/aemd8w.jpg<\/a><br><span>My Babies<\/span><br><span>\"Love isn't about finding a perfect person,<\/span><br><span>it's seeing an imperfect person perfectly!\"<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;125\/st\/20100505\/e\/We+Become+One%21+\/k\/00ff\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...00ff\/event.png<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/w27nJZW\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...JZW\/weight.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lil_miss_frogg@live.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1225992440,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212567.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lil_miss_frogg","Id":212567,"Name":"lil_miss_frogg","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":3901,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d4b0e29a991b8d8f3d0b1ef6d5d06761","RawContent":"Grear thread. Very helpful. Thank you","Attachments":[],"Id":516944,"PostDate":1227456004,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Grear thread. Very helpful. Thank you\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"olga1708@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1221610587,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211783.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":121,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"olga1708","Id":211783,"Name":"olga1708","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":3901,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7b7afdd843b1a176bb145b5909828b46","RawContent":"So many good ones to pick from!!\n Thanks for sharing these great ideas!!","Attachments":[],"Id":516951,"PostDate":1227456605,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So many good ones to pick from!!<br \/> Thanks for sharing these great ideas!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Melissa + Jason = Forever<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cEWycg360700NTQxNzJvfDY0ODUwc3xBIExvdmUgQXMgRGVlcCBBcyBUaGUgT2NlYW4.gif\">http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cEWycg3607...GUgT2NlYW4.gif<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"missybee99@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1217706479,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210943.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":77,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missybee99","Id":210943,"Name":"missybee99","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":3901,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"87f4559f4db63465934fb584e00620c0","RawContent":"Thanks for all the ideas on wording...I am still worried about this and I&#039;m picking the invites today. I just want something very simple, and think I&#039;m going to go with this one:\n \n BRIDE and GROOM\n \n request the honour of your presence\n On the beach at their marriage\n on DAY\n YEAR\n at TIME\n LOCATION\n ADDRESS\n CITY, STATE\n \n Then I&#039;ll put the local reception info at the bottom (is that where its supposed to go? or on a separate card?)","Attachments":[],"Id":639606,"PostDate":1238641565,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n     