. Thanks so much for the ideas! Here is wording we use a lot for our destination brides :) \n \n &lt;div align=\"center\"&gt;On the island of Oahu, \n amidst the swaying palms of Lanikuhonua \n together with our parents we, \n {Bride}\n and \n {Groom}\n invite you to share the unity of our hearts, \n our lives, and our cultures \n as we exchange vows and are united \n in the commitment of marriage \n on {Date}\n {Year}\n at {Time}\n \n Reception to follow&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":639876,"PostDate":1238679464,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow! What a great post. Thanks so much for the ideas! Here is wording we use a lot for our destination brides <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br \/> <br \/> <div align=\"center\">On the island of Oahu, <br \/> amidst the swaying palms of Lanikuhonua <br \/> together with our parents we, <br \/> {Bride}<br \/> and <br \/> {Groom}<br \/> invite you to share the unity of our hearts, <br \/> our lives, and our cultures <br \/> as we exchange vows and are united <br \/> in the commitment of marriage <br \/> on {Date}<br \/> {Year}<br \/> at {Time}<br \/> <br \/> Reception to follow<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@primandpixie.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238009534,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216151.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":79,"PhotoHeight":79,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"primandpixie","Id":216151,"Name":"primandpixie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":3901,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"362ec64659e26b447a264e97b50e078f","RawContent":"These are some great ideas!! Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":644403,"PostDate":1239043826,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                These are some great ideas!! Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicky.evans@sunbeltsupply.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1236869915,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215734.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Monkbridetobe","Id":215734,"Name":"Monkbridetobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":3901,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4811a1eccaa11aa3d6c17cb9b60fb162","RawContent":"Very helpful! Thanks for posting!","Attachments":[],"Id":644926,"PostDate":1239075468,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Very helpful! Thanks for posting!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"meghan.havill@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1238082205,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216180.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pvbeachbride10","Id":216180,"Name":"pvbeachbride10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":3901,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d018c84fcfcdbb57c5f2acc7029526bb","RawContent":"Thanks for posting these helpful phrases. We went the quirky route. We recently cancelled all our traditional wedding plans in our home town and booked a destination wedding...still inviting all 300+ guests. I have always wanted to get married on the beach and my wonderful FI and his amazing family finally saw my sadness with a mid-west wedding\/reception so they called the travel agent for me as a surprise. Our STD say &amp;quot;We&#039;re running away to get married! Please follow us.&amp;quot; and our website welcome says &amp;quot;We chose flip flops over high heels (I must admit I got that phrase from a wonderful bride who shared her website on BDW).&amp;quot; Hope this helps those who want to add some humor to the invities.","Attachments":[],"Id":645229,"PostDate":1239110303,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for posting these helpful phrases. We went the quirky route. We recently cancelled all our traditional wedding plans in our home town and booked a destination wedding...still inviting all 300+ guests. I have always wanted to get married on the beach and my wonderful FI and his amazing family finally saw my sadness with a mid-west wedding\/reception so they called the travel agent for me as a surprise. Our STD say \"We're running away to get married! Please follow us.\" and our website welcome says \"We chose flip flops over high heels (I must admit I got that phrase from a wonderful bride who shared her website on BDW).\" Hope this helps those who want to add some humor to the invities.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jessica0176@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1237677398,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216033.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bradleysgirl","Id":216033,"Name":"bradleysgirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":3901,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2e836751f7e65548b9a335d293329813","RawContent":"Thanks for the ideas, they are wonderful!","