9933b555146f6","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Becksy&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Mine reads:\n \n &lt;div align=\"center\"&gt;In a Caribbean Paradise\n Together with our Parents\n We Invite you to Share with us \n The Sun, the Sea and the Sand \n As we become Husband and Wife\n \n Name\n &amp;amp;\n Name\n \n Date\n Time\n \n Location\n \n At Home Reception to Follow\n details enclosed&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;LOVE this one! I think I will use it!","Attachments":[],"Id":1182899,"PostDate":1276437922,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Becksy<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Mine reads:<br \/> <br \/> <div align=\"center\">In a Caribbean Paradise<br \/> Together with our Parents<br \/> We Invite you to Share with us <br \/> The Sun, the Sea and the Sand <br \/> As we become Husband and Wife<br \/> <br \/> Name<br \/> &<br \/> Name<br \/> <br \/> Date<br \/> Time<br \/> <br \/> Location<br \/> <br \/> At Home Reception to Follow<br \/> details enclosed<\/div><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>LOVE this one! I think I will use it!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>50 Guests booked + the bride and groom!!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bladesy@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1261361855,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224024.bmp?_r=0","PhotoWidth":0,"PhotoHeight":0,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Princess J","Id":224024,"Name":"Princess J","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":3901,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9ace039083e1aaa41da0542ba526cacf","RawContent":"Mine was super simple\n \n Walking on the beach together, hand in had we&#039;ll be forever.\n \n brides name\n and \n grooms name \n \n Invite to join them in a tropical celebration as they unite in marriage....\n then I added the details after that","Attachments":[],"Id":1183070,"PostDate":1276455527,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Mine was super simple<br \/> <br \/> Walking on the beach together, hand in had we'll be forever.<br \/> <br \/> brides name<br \/> and <br \/> grooms name <br \/> <br \/> Invite to join them in a tropical celebration as they unite in marriage....<br \/> then I added the details after that\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ucruiser.com\/ticker\/carnival\/tickers\/fazcikplk5rtgqy0.png\">http:\/\/www.ucruiser.com\/ticker\/carni...plk5rtgqy0.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/mywedding.com\/brandiandstanforever\">http:\/\/mywedding.com\/brandiandstanforever<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"msbrandi701@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1157240204,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206791.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MSBRANDI","Id":206791,"Name":"MSBRANDI","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":3901,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9a2ced9a79a9f4b37be219c453b8cd35","RawContent":"I&#039;m working on my invites now and could use some feedback.\n Here&#039;s what I have:\n \n Blank and Blank (parents)\n Request the pleasure of your company\n At the beachside marriage of their daughter\n ME\n to\n FI\n On Friday, the third of September\n Two thousand and ten\n At five o&#039;clock in the afternoon\n Dreams Puerto Aventuras Resort &amp;amp; Spa,\n Quintana Roo, Mexico\n Sunset reception to follow\n \n Since I&#039;m getting married in Puerto Aventuras, which is in the state Quintana Roo, which is in the Mayan Riviera I&#039;m not sure which to put for the location.\n Any suggestions?","Attachments":[],"Id":1184533,"PostDate":1276564399,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm working on my invites now and could use some feedback.<br \/> Here's what I have:<br \/> <br \/> Blank and Blank (parents)<br \/> Request the pleasure of your company<br \/> At the beachside marriage of their daughter<br \/> ME<br \/> to<br \/> FI<br \/> On Friday, the third of September<br \/> Two thousand and ten<br \/> At five o'clock in the afternoon<br \/> Dreams Puerto Aventuras Resort & Spa,<br \/> Quintana Roo, Mexico<br \/> Sunset reception to follow<br \/> <br \/> Since I'm getting married in Puerto Aventuras, which is in the state Quintana Roo, which is in the Mayan Riviera I'm not sure which to put for the location.<br \/> Any suggestions?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/signaturepics\/sigpic27721_1.gif\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...pic27721_1.gif<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tickers\/tt89ffc.aspx\">http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tickers\/tt89ffc.aspx<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sierraporter@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1274629211,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228475.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tissey","Id":228475,"Name":"Tissey","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":3901,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"62ffc717fdb69787770581583d98a259","RawContent":"Some more great examples:\n &lt;div align=\"center\"&gt;\n A wonderful day in our lives\n is drawing near\n Valerie Marie Malta\n and\n Grant Paul Snyder\n would be honored and happy for you to\n share in the joy of their union in marriage \n \n \n \n The pleasure of your company\n is requested at the marriage of\n Melissa Ann Horne\n to\n Adam Galen Swift\n on Thursday, the sixteenth of October \n \n \n Our journey to find true love ends...\n our journey to cherish true love begins \n \n Because you have shared in\n our lives\n by your friendship and love we,\n Karrie Ester Bryant\n and\n Matthew Edward Ferguson\n together with our parents\n invite you to share the\n beginning of our new life\n together when we exchange\n marriage vows \n \n We decided on forever...\n and forever begins when we,\n Melissa Lee\n and\n Charles Bradley\n get married\n on October 9th, 2014 \n \n \n Say you&#039;ll share with me\n one love... one lifetime...\n say the word and I will follow\n you... that&#039;s all I ask of you...\n Jennifer Lynn Montello\n and\n Mark William Hanley Junior\n together with their families\n invite you to celebrate\n their special day \n \n \n Please celebrate with us\n the freshness of new life\n and new love as we,\n Dana Janine Clemens\n and\n Jason Steven Smith\n exchange wedding vows \n \n \n Some things are meant to be..\n The honour of your presence\n is requested as\n Autumn Lynn Jacobs\n and\n Michael Nathan Field\n are joined in marriage\n Saturday, the fourth of October \n \n We invite you to be with us\n as we begin our new life\n together\n on the first of February\n two thousand fourteen\n \n He asked, and she said yes...\n or was it the other way around?\n However it happened\n Marcy Punter\n and\n Geoff Smiggler\n are getting married \n &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1203629,"PostDate":1278117223,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Some more great examples:<br \/> <div align=\"center\"><br \/> A wonderful day in our lives<br \/> is drawing near<br \/> Valerie Marie Malta<br \/> and<br \/> Grant Paul Snyder<br \/> would be honored and happy for you to<br \/> share in the joy of their union in marriage <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> The pleasure of your company<br \/> is requested at the marriage of<br \/> Melissa Ann Horne<br \/> to<br \/> Adam Galen Swift<br \/> on Thursday, the sixteenth of October <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Our journey to find true love ends...<br \/> our journey to cherish true love begins <br \/> <br \/> Because you have shared in<br \/> our lives<br \/> by your friendship and love we,<br \/> Karrie Ester Bryant<br \/> and<br \/> Matthew Edward Ferguson<br \/> together with our parents<br \/> invite you to share the<br \/> beginning of our new life<br \/> together when we exchange<br \/> marriage vows <br \/> <br \/> We decided on forever...<br \/> and forever begins when we,<br \/> Melissa Lee<br \/> and<br \/> Charles Bradley<br \/> get married<br \/> on October 9th, 2014 <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Say you'll share with me<br \/> one love... one lifetime...<br \/> say the word and I will follow<br \/> you... that's all I ask of you...<br \/> Jennifer Lynn Montello<br \/> and<br \/> Mark William Hanley Junior<br \/> together with their families<br \/> invite you to celebrate<br \/> their special day <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Please celebrate with us<br \/> the freshness of new life<br \/> and new love as we,<br \/> Dana Janine Clemens<br \/> and<br \/> Jason Steven Smith<br \/> exchange wedding vows <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Some things are meant to be..<br \/> The honour of your presence<br \/> is requested as<br \/> Autumn Lynn Jacobs<br \/> and<br \/> Michael Nathan Field<br \/> are joined in marriage<br \/> Saturday, the fourth of October <br \/> <br \/> We invite you to be with us<br \/> as we begin our new life<br \/> together<br \/> on the first of February<br \/> two thousand fourteen<br \/> <br \/> He asked, and she said yes...<br \/> or was it the other way around?<br \/> However it happened<br \/> Marcy Punter<br \/> and<br \/> Geoff Smiggler<br \/> are getting married <br \/> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vovkina007@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1262551509,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224281.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LilRebel","Id":224281,"Name":"LilRebel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":3901,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f4b77a34b2ab3f0f35826db20080beaf","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td c