:0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0280ce6356a5e094c4c2a69f67848eb9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thank you, I&#039;ve been looking at alot of site to find wording for these.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Any suggestions or cute ideas of how to tell your guest to come barefoot, b\/c we will?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1276943,"PostDate":1283446030,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thank you, I've been looking at alot of site to find wording for these.<\/p> <p> Any suggestions or cute ideas of how to tell your guest to come barefoot, b\/c we will?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"capt2bspv@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1277297166,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229464.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":90,"PhotoHeight":72,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"capt2bspv","Id":229464,"Name":"capt2bspv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":3901,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"319ba76aa81f6c95fd96921fc8a7778e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wow-you Ladies have some amazing ideas!&amp;nbsp; We are getting married on the beach in Playa Del Carmen, Mexico on Valentine&#039;s Day &amp;amp; we&#039;re trying to figure out where in the invite to put the travel agent info??&amp;nbsp; For the Save The Dates, I printed out a stock card with her info for people to contact her for all travel arrangements. We need to add the info again in the invites, but I&#039;m not sure how to do this and I&#039;d like everything to match...any suggestions would be SO appreciated!!&amp;nbsp; Thank you very much :) Erin&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1279542,"PostDate":1283781580,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Wow-you Ladies have some amazing ideas!\u00a0 We are getting married on the beach in Playa Del Carmen, Mexico on Valentine's Day & we're trying to figure out where in the invite to put the travel agent info??\u00a0 For the Save The Dates, I printed out a stock card with her info for people to contact her for all travel arrangements. We need to add the info again in the invites, but I'm not sure how to do this and I'd like everything to match...any suggestions would be SO appreciated!!\u00a0 Thank you very much <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Erin<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"radiochic10@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1282818294,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231766.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"radiochic10","Id":231766,"Name":"radiochic10","IsOnl