p&gt; just pack your flip-flops and your speedos&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We invite you to share in the joy as&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; we begin our life together as husband and wife.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Angela&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; and&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Eric&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; will be married on the beach&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; DATE&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; TIME&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; PLACE&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1290414,"PostDate":1284831031,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I wanted something cute and casual...my fiance likes this one...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Forget your high heels and tuxedos,<\/p> <p> just pack your flip-flops and your speedos<\/p> <p> We invite you to share in the joy as<\/p> <p> we begin our life together as husband and wife.<\/p> <p> Angela<\/p> <p> and<\/p> <p> Eric<\/p> <p> will be married on the beach<\/p> <p> DATE<\/p> <p> TIME<\/p> <p> PLACE<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angmcole@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1284302826,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232266.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AngelaH","Id":232266,"Name":"AngelaH","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":3901,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate